Microsoft's current Excel Online (Business) connector supports Excel workbooks stored in SharePoint, and it supports running Office Scripts against SharePoint workbooks.  However, Microsoft doesn't provide a native SharePoint action that directly converts an XLSX workbook to PDF. A PDF conversion service is therefore the appropriate replacement. 

Recommended solution for your environment

I recommend:

